        "apparent": ""
      },
      "dateof": {
        "birth": "1921",
        "death": "1958"
      },
      "history": ""
    },
    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.uDNdrVnGBbAh18Tt]{Profile: Charles Halloway}</p><blockquote><p><em>“This city doesn&#39;t need a Prince who looks. It needs one who sees.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>The Uncrowned King</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Ventrue Primogen</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Ventrue</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>Camarilla</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>Adelaide Grange (PNJ-22)</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1921</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1958</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>The crown of Seattle.</td></tr><tr><th>Coterie</th><td>@UUID[JournalEntry.azX1hjbc0PUp2AA2.JournalEntryPage.zWDnUlWxPHfXyIA2]{The Glass Council}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Slim, medium height, black hair parted on the side, and tired brown eyes; a classic dark suit, white shirt, and thin tie.</p><section class=\"sbn-combate\"><h3>Charles Halloway · Combat Version</h3>\n<p><em>Full profile in Chapter 4.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Health</strong> 6 · <strong>Willpower</strong> 8 · <strong>Usual Hunger</strong> 1 · <strong>Blood Potency</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>Halloway doesn&#39;t fight.</strong> His defense pool is 6 (Dexterity + Wits) and he never attacks in person.</p>\n<p><strong>Dread Gaze</strong> (Presence 3): Charisma + Intimidation (6 dice) vs. Composure + Resolve. Whoever fails flees or freezes for one scene.</p>\n<p><strong>Dominate:</strong> Manipulation + Dominate (9 dice). He uses Compel (“Stop,” “Drop that”) and Forgetful Mind on mortal witnesses.</p>\n<p><strong>Fortitude 2:</strong> reduces superficial damage taken by 2.</p>\n<p><strong>Tactics:</strong> surround himself with ghouls (Dawson and @UUID[Actor.BzNGxOAK3F6Uo56T]{Halloway&#39;s Security Ghouls}), use Dread Gaze on the most dangerous opponent, and flee. On the ferry, toward the bridge. In the tower, toward the private elevator. If he&#39;s cornered with no way out, he negotiates: he offers everything.</p></section>",
    "appearance": "<p>Slim, medium height, black hair parted on the side, and tired brown eyes; a classic dark suit, white shirt, and thin tie.</p>",
    "equipment": "",
    "notes": "",
    "privatenotes": "<p>Editor&#39;s Note: doc 06 gave him five powers with Dominate 4 and three with Fortitude 2; Cloud Memory (Forgetful Mind covers it) and Resilience (his Health 6 doesn&#39;t include it) were removed, one per dot.</p>",
